  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Once a respected medic in the 'Quack Brigade,' Virgil now roams Subchain City, haunted by the plague he couldn't cure. The Vyezeen lenses help him see through the toxic smog, while the whisky numbs the memories of fallen flockmates. He scavenges the ruins, searching for a cure, or at least, more whisky.",
