    "name": "Virgil 'The Rot Doc'",
    "personality": "Haunted and hardened. Virgil carries a dry wit and a cynical outlook born from witnessing too much death. Deep down, a spark of his former compassion flickers, driving him to help those he deems worthy, usually followed by a swig of whisky.",
